# Chandra, Acolyte of Flame: "0: Put a loyalty counter on each red planeswalker you control." Bot1 controls Chandra (red),
# Wrenn and Six (red and green: red, though not only red) and Narset, Parter of Veils (blue); Bot2 controls its own Wrenn and
# Six. Chandra's 0 gives one counter to herself and to Bot1's Wrenn and Six only: not to the blue Narset, not to the opponent's
# red Wrenn and Six (CR 306.5c, 122.1e, 105.2).
# Chandra and Wrenn and Six come down on turn 1 off a Black Lotus, a Forest and a Mox Ruby; Narset on turn 3.

